# Normalize on commit, check out with LF everywhere.
#
# Development happens on Windows, but everything here that executes or is
# parsed does so on Linux. A shell script or config that arrives with CRLF
# fails in ways that read as a Docker problem and are not — the server guide
# records exactly that: `export: LC_ALL: bad variable name`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the files that actually run on the server.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.conf     text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.webp  binary
*.glb   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pdf   binary
